## APPENDIX: Study Tips (نصائح المذاكرة)

### Key Areas to Review (مناطق رئيسية للمراجعة)

**For AI Analytics Section:**
- [ ] Confidence score interpretation table
- [ ] Seasonality coefficients for Algerian market
- [ ] 6 dimensions of supplier matching (with weights)
- [ ] Churn risk levels and intervention triggers
- [ ] Pricing strategy selection criteria
- [ ] Model performance metrics (Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1)

**For Compliance Section:**
- [ ] TVA rates (19%/9%/0%) with examples
- [ ] Compliance score ranges and actions
- [ ] Sanctions match levels (Exact/High/Medium/Low/None)
- [ ] Document validity periods
- [ ] Response SLAs by severity level
- [ ] Key legal references (75-59, 76-147, 03-01, 18-07)

### Common Mistakes to Avoid (أخطاء شائجة يجب تجنبها)

1. **Confusing Precision and Recall** - Remember: Precision = quality of positive predictions; Recall = ability to find all positives
2. **Mixing up TVA rates** - Most products are 19%; only specific categories get 9% or 0%
3. **Wrong escalation timing** - Critical = <1 hour; Major = <24h; Moderate = <72h
4. **Document expiry confusion** - RC max 30 days; fiscal attestation per its printed date
5. **Sanctions over-reaction** - Not all matches require blocking; Low/Medium need review first

